WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
Didn’t it fall off twice yesterday? Tianju

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:02,800
Yesterday, after you entered the cave and lay down on the ground,

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,520
He was afraid that you would fall into a pit, so he went in to look for you.

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,440
As a result, he fell in again

5
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,560
I swallowed several mouthfuls

6
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:09,590
You are really greedy

7
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,100
There were still dozens of dollars left yesterday

8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,260
Let's have breakfast first

9
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:15,290
six yuan a serving

10
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:18,330
This can buy three kilograms of rice. It’s too expensive. What do you want to eat, boss?

11
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,770
Three portions of meat and egg rice rolls, Brother Xiao, I'll treat you to it

12
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,490
It’s okay to invite others to eat

13
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:23,530
Let yourself spend that money to eat

14
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:24,450
Still definitely feeling a little guilty

15
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:31,290
I, the common people of Shazhou City, are hungry now. How can I eat blindly? Brother Xiao, I will eat one portion and you can eat two portions. Don’t worry. You haven’t poured the sauce on it yet. Is this how it tastes?

16
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:33,930
So damn delicious

17
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:36,890
These people really know how to eat delicious food, right? It’s delicious.

18
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:37,810
Just delicious

19
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:39,650
I usually like to come to this restaurant to eat rice rolls.

20
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:40,690
Especially to my taste

21
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:42,010
After eating we go to the labor market

22
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:44,230
young man

23
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,150
You are such a big man

24
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:47,310
Why do you come here to work? I'm such a big man.

25
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:49,990
Can't you do this? It's not impossible. I think people like you

26
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:59,920
There should be a better job. If I can't find someone with 20,000 yuan to work for me, I'm not the boss. I can do it.

27
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:00,960
I can do anything

28
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,280
Stealing rice, stealing pollen, and eating tofu, who has better water quality?
